........................................................................................ 8 Concerns-based Adoption Model (CBAM)................................................................................ 9 Concerns-Based Adoption of Computer Technologies (CBAC", "the purpose of this study was to examine teachers\u2019 concerns, attitudes, beliefs, and pedagogical practices as it relates to technology integration............................................................................................................................................ 1 Research Questions....................................................................................................................... 2 Research Hypothesis...................................................................................................................... 2 Significance of Study................................................................................................................... 4 Limitations..................................................................................................................................... 4 Delimitations................................................................................................................................ 4 Assumptions................................................................................................................................ 4 Definition of Terms........................................................................................................................ 5 Chapter Two: Literature Review....................................................................................................."]], ["A comprehensive summary for our work would be that", ["this project was a study to determine if there were any differences in attitudes, beliefs, concerns, and pedagogical practices among teachers who had participated in technology integration professional development and those who had not.", "we were interested in how teachers in our district perceived the use of technology in their classroom and how they were using it.", "the use of technology in the classroom is a very important aspect in the field of education."]], ["The main takeaway from our work is that", ["we have learned that there is no one way to integrate technology in the classroom.", "teachers\u2019 concerns, attitudes, beliefs, and pedagogical practices are related to their use of technology in the classroom.", "the teachers\u2019 concerns about technology integration are not the main factor that inhibits technology integration."]]]